            <li>Check the display is actually connected before using it.</li>
            <li>Clear it, print a word, and push it to the glass.</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            No breadboard, no resistors, no pins to look up. This is the only
            part in the whole kit that connects with a single cable.
          </p>

