            <li>Close your editor. The board keeps running, and now you can still read it.</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            That last step is the point of the whole session. Everything you
            have built so far has needed a laptop to be useful. This does not.
          </p>

          <Code code={Task5} frame="code" lang="python" title="2-11-display.py" mark={{ range: "42-48" }} ins={{ range: "9,37,42-48" }} />

          <!-- PHOTO: OLED showing ARMED and a temperature, no laptop in frame -->
          <div
